{"sections":[{"slug":"形变量子化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形变量子化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">形变量子化</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"形变量子化"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathbb{C}[\\![\\hbar]\\!]$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">非交换</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">假设当我们令</span> $\\hbar = 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>\n$$\r\nA_0 := A \\otimes_{\\mathbb{C}[\\![\\hbar]\\!]} \\mathbb{C}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是交换代数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $A_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\{[a],[b]\\} := \\Big[\\frac{ab-ba}{\\hbar}\\Big].\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $[a]$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示</span> $a\\in A$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $A_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的像</span>.)\n<span lang=\"zh\">此时称</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">形变量子化</span></strong> (deformation quantization).</p>\n"}]}}}]}